Th'' afflicted''s pray''r he will not scorn.", "syllables": ["Th''", "afflic-", "ted''s", "pray''r", "he", "will", "not", "scorn."]}, {"text": "All times this shall be on record:", "bibleVerseRef": 18}, {"text": "And generations yet unborn"}, {"text": "Shall praise and magnify the Lord."}]}, {"index": 14, "lines": [{"text": "He from his holy place look''d down,", "syllables": ["He", "from", "his", "holy", "pla-", "ce", "look''d", "down,"], "bibleVerseRef": 19}, {"text": "The earth he view''d from heav''n on high;"}, {"text": "To hear the pris''ner''s mourning groan,", "syllables": ["To", "hear", "the", "pris''ner''s", "mour-", "ning", "gro-", "an,"], "bibleVerseRef": 20}, {"text": "And free them that are doom''d to die;"}]}, {"index": 15, "lines": [{"text": "That Sion, and Jerus''lem too,", "syllables": ["That", "Sio-", "n,", "and", "je-", "rus-", "''lem", "too,"], "bibleVerseRef": 21}, {"text": "His name and praise may well record,"}, {"text": "When people and the kingdoms do", "syllables": ["When", "peo-", "ple", "and", "the", "kin-", "gdoms", "do"], "bibleVerseRef": 22}, {"text": "Assemble all to praise the Lord."}]}, {"index": 16, "lines": [{"text": "My strength he weaken''d in the way,", "syllables": ["My", "stre-", "ngth", "he", "weaken''d", "in", "the", "way,"], "bibleVerseRef": 23}, {"text": "My days of life he shortened"}, {"text": "My God, O take me not away", "bibleVerseRef": 24}, {"text": "In mid-time of my days, I said:", "syllables": ["In", "mid-ti-", "me", "of", "my", "days,", "I", "said:"]}]}, {"index": 17, "lines": [{"text": "Thy years throughout all ages last", "syllables": ["Thy", "years", "throu-", "-", "ghout", "all", "ages", "last"]}, {"text": "Of old thou hast established", "bibleVerseRef": 25}, {"text": "The earth''s foundation firm and fast:"}, {"text": "Thy mighty hands the heav''ns have made."}]}, {"index": 18, "lines": [{"text": "They perish shall, as garments do,", "bibleVerseRef": 26}, {"text": "But thou shalt evermore endure;", "syllab